                India's #1 Live Coaching Platform
              </p>
            </div>

            {/* ── PHASE 2: Features (0.2 - 0.4) ── */}
            <div 
              className="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-end pb-32 z-30"
              style={{ 
